COMMENT     Assembly name: 6071 sequences that have an 1:1 hydra:human ortholog
            Description: Orthology of 6071 hydra transcripts was assigned based
            on the Reciprocal Best Hit (RBH) approach between hydra and human.
            To do so, Hydra transcripts were conceptually translated and
            compared to the human swissprot transcriptome.
